{"suttaId":"tha-ap60","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4127,4157],"vripara":"57"},"segments":{"tha-ap60:0.3":"Dhajadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap60:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, bodhiyā pādaputtame;","tha-ap60:1.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, dhajamāropayiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap60:2.1":"“Patitapattāni gaṇhitvā, bahiddhā chaḍḍayiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap60:2.3":"Antosuddhaṃ bahisuddhaṃ, adhimuttamanāsavaṃ.","tha-ap60:3.1":"“Sammukhā viya sambuddhaṃ, avandiṃ bodhimuttamaṃ;","tha-ap60:3.3":"Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho.","tha-ap60:4.1":"“Bhikkhusaṅghe ṭhito satthā, imā gāthā abhāsatha;","tha-ap60:4.3":"“‘Iminā dhajadānena, upaṭṭhānena cūbhayaṃ.","tha-ap60:5.1":"“‘Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ so na gacchati;","tha-ap60:5.3":"Devesu devasobhagyaṃ, anubhossatinappakaṃ.","tha-ap60:6.1":"“‘Anekasatakkhattuñca, rājā raṭṭhe bhavissati;","tha-ap60:6.3":"Uggato nāma nāmena, cakkavattī bhavissati.","tha-ap60:7.1":"“‘Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap60:7.3":"Gotamassa bhagavato, sāsanebhiramissati’.","tha-ap60:8.1":"“Padhānapahitattomhi, upasanto nirūpadhi;","tha-ap60:8.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap60:9.1":"“Ekapaññāsasahasse, kappe uggatasavhayo [savhayā (syā.)];","tha-ap60:9.3":"Paññāsasatasahasse, khattiyo meghasavhayo [khattiyā khemasavhayā (syā.)].","tha-ap60:10.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap60:11.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā dhajadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap60:12.1":"Dhajadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2589,"to":2590,"paras":[{"para":2589,"vripara":"57","refs":["tha-ap60:1"],"lines":["So pattaarahattaphalo pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto attano pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttarabuddhassā</b>tiādimāha.","Tassattho pubbe vuttoyeva.","<b>Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittenā</b>ti somanassasahagatacittayuttattā haṭṭho paripuṇṇarūpakāyo saddhāsampayuttacittatāya haṭṭhena cittena santuṭṭhena cittenāti attho.","<b>Dhajamāropayiṃ ahan</b>ti dhunāti kampati calatīti dhajaṃ, taṃ dhajaṃ āropayiṃ veḷagge laggetvā pūjesinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap60:1"],["tha-ap60:1"],["tha-ap60:1"],["tha-ap60:1"]]},{"para":2590,"vripara":"58-59","refs":["tha-ap60:2"],"lines":["58-9. <b>Patitapattāni gaṇhitvā</b>ti patitāni bodhipattāni gahetvā ahaṃ bahi chaḍḍesinti attho.","<b>Antosuddhaṃ bahisuddhan</b>ti anto cittasantānanāmakāyato ca bahi cakkhusotādirūpakāyato ca suddhiṃ <b>adhi</b> visesena <b>muttaṃ</b> kilesato vimuttaṃ anāsavaṃ sambuddhaṃ viya sammukhā uttamaṃ bodhiṃ <b>avandiṃ</b> paṇāmamakāsinti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap60:2"],["tha-ap60:2"],["tha-ap60:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap60:1.1","padumuttarabuddhassā",0,0],["tha-ap60:1.3","haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittenā",0,2],["tha-ap60:1.3","dhajamāropayiṃ ahaṃ",0,3],["tha-ap60:2.1","patitapattāni gaṇhitvā",1,0],["tha-ap60:2.3","adhi",1,1],["tha-ap60:2.3","antosuddhaṃ bahisuddhaṃ",1,1],["tha-ap60:2.3","muttaṃ",1,1]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
